Generation(liveCells: Cell[]): Cell[] {\n  const live = new Set(liveCells.map(([x, y]) => key(x, y)));\n  const neighborCounts = new Map<string, number>();\n\n  // For every live cell, increment neighbor counts for the 8 surrounding cells.\n  for (const [x, y] of liveCells) {\n    for (let dx = -1; dx <= 1; dx++) {\n      for (let dy = -1; dy <= 1; dy++) {\n        if (dx === 0 && dy === 0) continue;\n        const k = key(x + dx, y + dy);\n        neighborCounts.set(k, (neighborCounts.get(k) ?? 0) + 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  const next: Cell[] = [];\n  for (const [k, count] of neighborCounts) {\n    const aliveNext = count === 3 || (count === 2 && live.has(k));\n    if (aliveNext) {\n      const [x, y] = k.split(\",\").map(Number);\n      next.push([x, y]);\n    }\n  }\n  return next;\n}\n```\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all 10 tests green. Run autonomously, return when done."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/minimax-m3","usage":{"input":284,"output":587,"cacheRead":83456,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1,"totalTokens":84327,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784970960190,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-a6ab9076-3391-4bb7-9c28-edf981a4063e","responseModel":"minimax/minimax-m3"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_59a71f3f37454818b084969d","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Step 5: New APP Mass\n\nRefactored component counts:\n- **Constants**: `,` (template), `\",\"` (split), `-1`×2, `1`×2, `0`×3 (in countNeighbors), `3`, `2` = **11**\n- **Bindings**: key+2params, parseKey+k+x+y, countNeighbors+lives+counts+x+y+dx+dy+k, isAliveNext+count+wasAlive, nextGen+lives+live+x+y+neighborCounts+next+k+count = **26**\n- **Invocations**: key, liveCells.map, new Set, parseKey, next.push, countNeighbors, isAliveNext, live.has, new Map, key, set, get, split, .map(Number) = **13** → mass 26\n- **Conditionals**: 2 (skip-self, aliveNext) → mas